@THE NAVI Mumbai International Airport willstart commercial operations. The first flight will depart from Bengaluru and the Navi Mumbai International Airport, formally marking the inauguration of Phase 1 operations at the greenfield airport. Phase 1 of NMIAcanhandle about 20 million passengers.

@PRIME MINISTER Narendra Modi is scheduledtoinaugurate theRashtraPrerna Sthal in Lucknow that will host, among others, statues of BJP ideologues Syama Prasad Mookerjee, Pandit Deendayal Upadhyaya and former Prime Minister Atal Bihari Vajpayee. Hewillalso addressa public gathering.

